	"img": "icons/magic/life/cross-yellow-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<h2>Recuperative Enhancement</h2><p>When you recover hit points by expending hit dice, you recover the maximum value. When healed by an external effect of psionics, magic, or technology, you add your constitution modifier to the amount healed.</p><h2>Regeneration</h2><p>Any lost limb or digit regrows within 1d6+1 days unless replaced with a cybernetic.</p><h2>Overactive Immune System</h2><p>While you are infected with a disease, you automatically expend one hit die each day to make a saving throw against the disease. On a failed saving throw, you may expend additional hit dice to make additional saving throws, but take damage equal to the value rolled on each additional die.</p>",
